OL,3,AMass arrests in global crackdown on
OL,4,AWest African cyber-crime networks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifty-eight people linked to organised
OL,7,FWest African cyber-crime groups have
OL,8,Fbeen arrested in an operation across 22
OL,9,Fcountries and six continents.
OL,11,FDubbed "Operation Jackal IV", it was
OL,12,Fco-ordinated by the global policing
OL,13,Fagency Interpol, targeting those behind
OL,14,Fromance and investment scams. It also
OL,15,Fidentified 263 suspects.
OL,17,FInterpol said it was a response to the
OL,18,Fescalating global threat posed by these
OL,19,Fcriminal networks - such as the feared
OL,20,FNigerian Black Axe group - believed to
OL,21,Fbe behind a "significant share" of
OL,22,Fcyber-enabled financial fraud.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
