OL,3,AMass arrests in global crackdown on
OL,4,AWest African cyber-crime networks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operation also allowed analysis of
OL,7,Femerging trends such as how these
OL,8,Fgroups use sextortion to target minors,
OL,9,Fwith victims as young as 14.
